WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.040
- Your daughter Banks, she
also got a cool present, right,

00:00:02.040 --> 00:00:02.873
for her birthday this year?

00:00:02.873 --> 00:00:03.706
- She did.

00:00:03.706 --> 00:00:04.539
- Yeah.
- She did.

00:00:04.539 --> 00:00:05.460
I mean, she got a lot of cool presents,

00:00:05.460 --> 00:00:07.920
but I think the most exciting one for her,

00:00:07.920 --> 00:00:10.350
is she's a massive Harry Styles fan.

00:00:10.350 --> 00:00:11.550
- So is my son.
(audience member cheers)

00:00:11.550 --> 00:00:13.740
- Okay, so, I mean, so am I.

00:00:13.740 --> 00:00:14.573
- Me too.

00:00:14.573 --> 00:00:17.310
- So when we bought the tickets,
I was like this is for me.

00:00:17.310 --> 00:00:18.990
- Me too.
- Kinda like the hair tinsel.

00:00:18.990 --> 00:00:20.370
- I got a full-on suite, girl.

00:00:20.370 --> 00:00:21.600
I was like, yeah.
(audience laughing)

00:00:21.600 --> 00:00:22.433
- It was so good.

00:00:22.433 --> 00:00:25.680
And I have to tell you, Matt,
my husband watches a show.

00:00:25.680 --> 00:00:28.830
Like just, I'm like, "are
you having a good time?

00:00:28.830 --> 00:00:29.663
You enjoying this?"

00:00:29.663 --> 00:00:31.110
And he's having the time of his life

00:00:31.110 --> 00:00:34.411
but he's just like, absorbing
and like staring and like

00:00:34.411 --> 00:00:37.931
and I'm like over here
like, "yeah we're partying.

00:00:37.931 --> 00:00:38.953
I'm singing along."

00:00:38.953 --> 00:00:39.786
And he's like,

00:00:39.786 --> 00:00:40.770
- I'm singing and dancing.
- "I can't hear because

00:00:40.770 --> 00:00:43.890
you're singing so loud and
embarrassing all of us."

00:00:43.890 --> 00:00:45.600
And then Banks did the same thing.

00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:47.940
And when we were driving I
thought she was gonna rip

00:00:47.940 --> 00:00:50.940
her car seat out, she
was like, every word,

00:00:50.940 --> 00:00:52.410
just like jamming so hard.

00:00:52.410 --> 00:00:54.720
Wanted her window down, hair like flying

00:00:54.720 --> 00:00:56.070
and then we got there and she was like-

00:00:56.070 --> 00:00:57.600
- That's my son.
(audience laughing)

00:00:57.600 --> 00:00:58.440
That's Remy.

00:00:58.440 --> 00:00:59.460
- What's going on?
- He sat

00:00:59.460 --> 00:01:00.757
and it was almost like, he was like,

00:01:00.757 --> 00:01:03.180
"how do I memorize all these
moves so I can be him?"

00:01:03.180 --> 00:01:04.039
- Yeah, yeah.
- It was like,

00:01:04.039 --> 00:01:05.359
he was just watching like

00:01:05.359 --> 00:01:06.480
so intently.
- Taking notes.

00:01:06.480 --> 00:01:08.910
- So cute, yeah.
- Taking notes.

